Z||000014||beer_stud_21||08-22-2001||06:01 PM||||Well I will have you all know that I'm no japanaime (or whatever you call it) fan.  Personally I have dual monitors.  A McLaren F1 LM on my main monitor and that new porshe carrera GT on my second monitor.  As for Operating Systems.  I think <A HREF="http://www.apple.com/macosx/" TARGET=_blank>Mac OS X</A> is the way to go.  My mac is two old to run it very well, especially with all the stuff I have packed into it.  But I have played with it on a brand new iBook (which is very nice btw) and its going to make an awsome new operating system.  The power of UNIX with an apple designed GUI.  Very sweet.  <P>-Marlin||||reg||1
